@refactor_exercise_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Standard member
POST {{refactor_exercise_HostAddress}}/applyDiscount/order-1001/SAVE10
Accept: application/json

### Premium member
POST {{refactor_exercise_HostAddress}}/applyDiscount/order-1002/SAVE10
Accept: application/json

### Expired coupon
POST {{refactor_exercise_HostAddress}}/applyDiscount/order-1001/EXPIRED
Accept: application/json

### Unknown order
POST {{refactor_exercise_HostAddress}}/applyDiscount/missing/SAVE10
Accept: application/json
